Human-AI collaboration. Say it with me. Human-AI collaboration!

10
00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:06.439
Originality. Say it with me. Originality!

11
00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:14.388
Copyright question. Say it with me. Copyright question!

12
00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:22.815
